OL,3,GNEWSAMe, Sussex and crime go way back,
OL,4,Asays Richard Osman
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Osman's hit debut novel, The
OL,7,FThursday Murder Club, was inspired by
OL,8,Fthe residents of his mother's real-life
OL,9,Fretirement village in Burgess Hill.
OL,11,FIn addition, his four-times
OL,12,Fgreat-grandfather was an amateur sleuth
OL,13,Fwho became a key witness in a notorious
OL,14,F19th Century Brighton murder case - a
OL,15,Ffact uncovered on BBC One's Who Do You
OL,16,FThink You Are? in 2022.
OL,18,FSo it is little wonder the former
OL,19,FPointless presenter-turned-bestselling
OL,20,Fauthor feels such an affinity with
OL,21,FSussex.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
