OL,3,GNEWSAMe, Sussex and crime go way back,
OL,4,Asays Richard Osman
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I feel very rooted there," said the
OL,7,F55-year-old, who was brought up in
OL,8,FHaywards Heath. "In fact, you could say
OL,9,Fthat me, Sussex and crime go back a
OL,10,Flong way."
